---
import LegalDocLayout from "../../../components/LegalDocLayout.astro";

const title = "Privacy policy — PRIME";
const description =
  "How PRIME LLC processes personal data on the English version of prime-ltd.su.";
---

<LegalDocLayout title={title} description={description} path="/en/legal/privacy/">
  <h1>Personal data processing policy</h1>
  <p class="legal-lead">
    This English version explains how PRIME LLC (ООО «ПРАЙМ») processes personal data on
    <a href="https://prime-ltd.su/en/">https://prime-ltd.su/en/</a> and related English pages.
    Processing follows Russian Federal Law No. 152-FZ “On Personal Data”.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Controller</h2>
  <p>
    PRIME LLC (ООО «ПРАЙМ»), registered address: 394026, Voronezh, Moskovsky Prospekt 19,
    office 19, Russian Federation. Contact for privacy requests:
    <a href="mailto:info@prime-ltd.su">info@prime-ltd.su</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>2. What we process</h2>
  <p>Depending on how you use the site, we may process:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>name and contact details you submit in forms (e.g. phone, email, message text);</li>
    <li>technical data: IP address, browser/OS, device and screen parameters, referral URL, UTM tags;</li>
    <li>usage data: pages viewed, session duration, clicks and similar interaction events;</li>
    <li>cookie identifiers and similar technologies (see Cookie policy).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not intentionally collect special categories of personal data (health, political views,
    religion, biometric data, etc.) via this website.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Purposes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>responding to requests and providing consultations;</li>
    <li>preparing proposals for digital marketing, SEO, Google Ads, websites and analytics;</li>
    <li>operating, securing and improving the website;</li>
    <li>measuring traffic and campaign effectiveness where analytics tools are enabled;</li>
    <li>complying with applicable law and defending legal claims.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Legal bases</h2>
  <p>
    Processing is based on your consent (forms and optional cookies/analytics), performance of
    pre-contractual steps at your request, and legitimate interests in running and securing the
    website — within the limits of 152-FZ and other applicable rules.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Cookies and recommendation technologies</h2>
  <p>
    Details are in the
    <a href="/en/legal/cookies/">Cookie policy</a>
    and
    <a href="/en/legal/recommendations/">Recommendation technologies</a>
    pages. You can disable cookies in your browser; essential cookies required for basic site
    operation may still apply.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Recipients and processors</h2>
  <p>
    Data may be accessed by authorised PRIME staff and, where needed, by processors who help us
    host the site, deliver email, or provide analytics — under confidentiality and security
    obligations. We do not sell personal data.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Retention</h2>
  <p>
    We keep data only as long as needed for the stated purposes, contractual limitation periods,
    tax/accounting rules, or until you withdraw consent where processing is consent-based — unless
    a longer period is required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
  <p>Subject to applicable law, you may request access, rectification, blocking or deletion of
    your personal data, and withdraw consent. Send requests to
    <a href="mailto:info@prime-ltd.su">info@prime-ltd.su</a>.
    You may also contact the competent authority in your jurisdiction or Roskomnadzor in Russia.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Security</h2>
  <p>
    We apply organisational and technical measures aimed at protecting personal data against
    unauthorised access, loss or alteration, in line with 152-FZ requirements.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Updates</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy. The current English text is published on this page. Continued use
    of the site after changes means you have read the updated version.
  </p>
</LegalDocLayout>
